{"id":"e_gard","lemma":"égard","pos":"noun","rank":4205,"glosses":["consideration"],"ipa":"/e.ɡaʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/Fr-%C3%A9gard.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9gard.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"égards"},"examples":[{"text":"À cet égard, je n'ai rien à dire.","en":"I have nothing to say in this regard.","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to say, to tell"}]},{"text":"J'ai une dette à son égard.","en":"I owe him a debt.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"debt"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Mon attitude à son égard a changé.","en":"My attitude towards him changed.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"attitude, position"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"changer"}]},{"text":"J'ai de vrais sentiments à votre égard.","en":"I've got real feelings for you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"true","l":"vrai"},{"g":"a sentiment","l":"sentiment"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Ils ont été très gentils à mon égard.","en":"They were very kind to me.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"kind, sweet","l":"gentil"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}